{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>RadioWatch 是一款讓你在 iPhone 與 Apple Watch 上收聽全球數千個直播電台的應用程式，即使 iPhone 留在家中，手錶仍可透過蜂窩網絡或 Wi-Fi 獨立串流。適合喜歡收聽世界各地電台、運動或通勤時不想帶著手機的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-163.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>手錶獨立串流全球電台</h2>\n<p>RadioWatch 收錄全球數千個直播電台，可按國家、類型或語言瀏覽，並提供熱門與趨勢排行。收藏與最近播放透過 iCloud 在 iPhone 與 Apple Watch 之間同步。手錶版能自行以蜂窩網絡或 Wi-Fi 串流，配合藍牙耳機收聽；另支援 CarPlay、Siri、AirPlay，以及在鎖定畫面與控制中心顯示正在播放的歌曲。程式無廣告、無需帳戶、不追蹤用戶。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-437-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-438-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-439-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-440-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-441-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：RadioWatch: Live Radio</li><li>應用類別：Music</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/radiowatch-live-radio/id6820977122?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.224581+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":399,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T12:09:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:18:26.565668+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:25.932093+00:00","content_hash":"9dd2a6a45dad017a886c6c4df1c9a70855b43673264782bb314ec7c9def773b5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}